# Solo merge workflow

This repo has a single maintainer. When finishing a feature branch:

1. Still use a feature branch and commits for the work itself.
2. When asked to merge, ship, or land the work: merge into `main` promptly (local merge + push, or create a PR and merge it immediately).
3. Do not wait for review, extra approval rounds, or leave an open unmerged PR unless the user asks to keep it open.
4. Prefer deleting the remote feature branch after merge when using GitHub.
5. Do not force-push `main`.
